    "code": " n = int(input()) * 2\n\narr = sorted(int(x) for x in input().split())\n\nx = arr[n - 1]\n\nfor i in range(n):\n\n    for j in range(i + 1, n):\n\n        a, q = 0, 0\n\n        for h in range(n):\n\n            if h == i or h == j:\n\n                continue\n\n            if q % 2 == 0:\n\n                a -= arr[h]\n\n            else:\n\n                a += arr[h]\n\n            q += 1\n\n        x = min(x, a)\n\nprint(x)",
